ABBAS KAHA HO MERI IMDAAD KO AAO<br>
<br>
MAAJAYE KA SAR KAT TAY HI IS DASHT-E-BALA MAIN,<br>
 AAYE HAIN SITAMGAR YAHAAN KHAIMO KO JALANE,<br>
 BABA BHI NAHI AAYE HAIN ZAINAB KO BACCHANE,<br>
 IS BAN MAIN LOOT TI HOON MADAD KARNE AOO<br>
<br>
WO RAAT KA SANNATA WO BACCHON KA BILAKH NA,<br>
 AUR KHOUF SE ZA LIM KE WO BEWOA KA LARAZNA,<br>
 DEKHA NAHIN JATA HAI SAKINA KA TADAPNA,<br>
 KURTE MAIN LAGI AAG HAI TUM AAKE BACCHAO<br>
<br>
MASOOM KO DURRE JO LAGATA HAIN SITAMGAR,<br>
 KHAMOOSH KHADE ROTE HAIN BAS ABID-E-BIMAR,<br>
 KAANO SE LAHOO BEHTA HAIN AUR SOOJHE HAIN RUQSAR,<br>
 AB AAKE BHATIJEE KO KALEJE SE LAGAYO<br>
<br>
ZEHRA KI BAHOO BETIYON KE HAATH BADHEIN HAI,<br>
 BE MAQNA-O-CHADAR SAR-E-BAZAAR PHIRE HAI,<br>
 DARBAR MAIN ZALIM KE BHI SAR NANGE KHADE HAI,<br>
 HOTA HA I TAROOF MERA TUM AAKE RUKAOO<br>
<br>
JAB BEESWI RAMZAN KO YE BABA NE KAHA THA,<br>
 ZAINAB TERE BAAZO MAIN RASAN BANDHEIN GE AADA,<br>
 PAR DIL KO YAKEEN THA MERE ABBBAS HAIN ZINDA,<br>
 AB CHEENTI HAI CHADAR MERI TUM AAKE DILAOO<br>
<br>
ZANJEER MAIN JAKHDA HAIN MERA ABID-E-DILGIR,<br>
 CHALNE MAIN USSE HOTI HAIN EK LAMHA JO TAQEER,<br>
 NAIZE SE AZIYAT USSE POUNCHA TE HAIN BE PEER,<br>
 BIMAR KO TUM AAKE LAIEEN NO CHOODAOO<br>
<br>
NOUHA YE LIKHA MOOSAVI NE BA DIL-E-PURNAM,<br>
 HASRAT HAI KAROON ROUZA PA PHIR MAJLIS-O-MATAM,<br>
 AUR SAATH HAIN PARWANE SADA DETE HAIN PAIHAM,<br>
 BHAIYYA YE AZADARO KO ROUZE PA BULAOO..